# Local key material, not configuration.
#
# Relative paths in a config resolve against THAT CONFIG FILE'S directory
# (components/agent/src/config.rs::load, components/cli/src/config.rs::
# resolve_path), so both of these land HERE and nowhere else:
#
#   data/  — cli.dev.toml's cluster-a profile names ca_cert =
#            "data/meisterstack/ca.pem", i.e. config/data/. The lab CA is
#            copied in by hand; it is not ours to publish.
#   pki/   — `meister login` puts <config dir>/pki/<profile>.{key,crt} for
#            any profile that names no mtls credential yet, and cli.dev.toml
#            has two such profiles. That directory holds PRIVATE KEYS.
#
# The agent's own runtime tree is NOT here: agent.dev.toml says
# "../data/lib/meisterstack", which resolves to <repo>/data and is covered
# by the root .gitignore's /data entry. config/data/ never appears from
# running the agent, which is what an earlier version of this file claimed.
data/
pki/
